# The image needs only Pi's context file, skills and Git config from the build
# context, and from the personal Pi config in pi-agent/personal/ only the config
# files below (docs/adr/0006-personal-pi-config.md). Everything else there stays
# out: Pi's credentials and state, models.json, and context files that would
# replace the sandbox's AGENTS.md.
*
!pi-agent/
pi-agent/personal/*
!pi-agent/personal/settings.json
!pi-agent/personal/keybindings.json
!pi-agent/personal/mcp.json
!pi-agent/personal/SYSTEM.md
!pi-agent/personal/APPEND_SYSTEM.md
!pi-agent/personal/extensions/
!pi-agent/personal/skills/
!pi-agent/personal/prompts/
!pi-agent/personal/themes/
pi-agent/**/*.test.mjs
